{"v":4,"catch":"光明與黑暗的較量！\n傳說中的巨龍重生，歷經無數歲月。","desc":"《DRAGON SPIRIT》是《NAMCO》於1987年發行的一款射擊遊戲。\n控制變身為“Blue Dragon”的英雄“Amul”，拯救被黑暗領主“Zawell”帶走的米德加德公主“Alicia”\n與地面和空中的敵人作戰，並使用強化物品在這些地區前進。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-03-03","genres":["射擊","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/de5a02949f6ed11a6a93cb5a68532cca4288ded966a535eadaceb2b8e44713ad.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5f0044e0e497d2a7eba590ecf8f1d0b47b9e7306c645798b9d44bd2ca306e58c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b7eeecb7cd08147ed178b801b12206c320161599403b2b417b98394ca56539a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/90f66d806fa5e224124ac33fd11ab87148e10d9d751adf54215852fb180beb55.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/82fc87d8f9869a7d5fcad5ffa8e0fe3a25f582dfac2a5eabad3c78fef362a643.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/7381587e20cf489e1637a8d5a7b686981d926bebc1ff53efdac498c1f61d501d.jpg"],"titleId":"010092201711e000","dlc":[]}